{
  "title": "ISic001692. An antiquarian 'forgery'",
  "body": "<div id=\"editions\"><div class=\"attribution\">Text encoding: Jonathan Prag</div><div id=\"edition-interpretive\" lang=\"la\">  <div class=\"textpart\" lang=\"la\"><span class=\"ab\" id=\"div-interpretive\">  <a id=\"al1-interpretive\"><!--0--></a><span class=\"linenumber\">1</span><span data-text=\"L\" data-n=\"5\" data-lemma=\"L\">L(- - -)</span>  <span data-text=\"L\" data-n=\"10\" data-lemma=\"L\">L(- - -)</span>  <span data-text=\"D\" data-n=\"15\" data-lemma=\"D\">D(- - -)</span>  <span data-type=\"name\" data-name-type=\"\" data-text=\"Augusto\"><span data-text=\"Augusto\" data-n=\"20\" data-lemma=\"Augustus\">Augusto</span></span>  <span data-text=\"sacrum\" data-n=\"25\" data-lemma=\"sacer\">sacrum</span>  <span data-text=\"et\" data-n=\"30\" data-lemma=\"et\">et</span>  <span data-text=\"genio\" data-n=\"35\" data-lemma=\"genius\">genio</span>  <span data-text=\"civitatis\" data-n=\"40\" data-lemma=\"civitas\">civitatis</span>  <br id=\"al2-interpretive\"><span class=\"linenumber\">2</span><span data-text=\"populus\" data-n=\"45\" data-lemma=\"populus\">populus</span>  <span data-text=\"Drepanitorum\" data-n=\"50\" data-lemma=\"Drepanitus\">Drepanit(orum)</span>  </span></div>  <p class=\"miniapp\"></p></div><div class=\"attribution\">Text encoding: Robert Crellin</div><div id=\"edition-interpretive-simple-lemmatized\">  <div class=\"textpart\"><span class=\"ab\" id=\"div-interpretive\">  <span data-text=\"L\" data-n=\"5\" data-lemma=\"L\">L</span>  <span data-text=\"L\" data-n=\"10\" data-lemma=\"L\">L</span>  <span data-text=\"D\" data-n=\"15\" data-lemma=\"D\">D</span>  <span data-text=\"Augusto\" data-n=\"20\" data-lemma=\"Augustus\">Augusto</span>  <span data-text=\"sacrum\" data-n=\"25\" data-lemma=\"sacer\">sacrum</span>  <span data-text=\"et\" data-n=\"30\" data-lemma=\"et\">et</span>  <span data-text=\"genio\" data-n=\"35\" data-lemma=\"genius\">genio</span>  <span data-text=\"civitatis\" data-n=\"40\" data-lemma=\"civitas\">civitatis</span>  <span data-text=\"populus\" data-n=\"45\" data-lemma=\"populus\">populus</span>  <span data-text=\"Drepanitorum\" data-n=\"50\" data-lemma=\"Drepanitus\">Drepanitorum</span>  </span></div>  <p class=\"miniapp\"></p></div><div class=\"attribution\">Text encoding: Jonathan Prag</div><div id=\"edition-diplomatic\" lang=\"la\"><div class=\"textpart\" lang=\"la\"><span class=\"ab\" id=\"div-diplomatic\"><a id=\"al1-diplomatic\"><!--0--></a><span class=\"linenumber\">1</span><span data-text=\"L\" data-n=\"5\" data-lemma=\"L\">L</span><span data-text=\"L\" data-n=\"10\" data-lemma=\"L\">L</span><span data-text=\"D\" data-n=\"15\" data-lemma=\"D\">D</span><span data-type=\"name\" data-name-type=\"\" data-text=\"Augusto\"><span data-text=\"Augusto\" data-n=\"20\" data-lemma=\"Augustus\">AUGUSTO</span></span><span data-text=\"sacrum\" data-n=\"25\" data-lemma=\"sacer\">SACRUM</span><span data-text=\"et\" data-n=\"30\" data-lemma=\"et\">ET</span><span data-text=\"genio\" data-n=\"35\" data-lemma=\"genius\">GENIO</span><span data-text=\"civitatis\" data-n=\"40\" data-lemma=\"civitas\">CIVITATIS</span><br id=\"al2-diplomatic\"><span class=\"linenumber\">2</span><span data-text=\"populus\" data-n=\"45\" data-lemma=\"populus\">POPULUS</span><span data-text=\"Drepanitorum\" data-n=\"50\" data-lemma=\"Drepanitus\">DREPANIT</span></span></div><p class=\"miniapp\"></p></div><div class=\"attribution\">Text encoding: Robert Crellin</div><div id=\"edition-diplomatic-simple-lemmatized\"><div class=\"textpart\"><span class=\"ab\" id=\"div-diplomatic\"><span data-text=\"L\" data-n=\"5\" data-lemma=\"L\">L</span><span data-text=\"L\" data-n=\"10\" data-lemma=\"L\">L</span><span data-text=\"D\" data-n=\"15\" data-lemma=\"D\">D</span><span data-text=\"Augusto\" data-n=\"20\" data-lemma=\"Augustus\">AUGUSTO</span><span data-text=\"sacrum\" data-n=\"25\" data-lemma=\"sacer\">SACRUM</span><span data-text=\"et\" data-n=\"30\" data-lemma=\"et\">ET</span><span data-text=\"genio\" data-n=\"35\" data-lemma=\"genius\">GENIO</span><span data-text=\"civitatis\" data-n=\"40\" data-lemma=\"civitas\">CIVITATIS</span><span data-text=\"populus\" data-n=\"45\" data-lemma=\"populus\">POPULUS</span><span data-text=\"Drepanitorum\" data-n=\"50\" data-lemma=\"Drepanitus\">DREPANITORUM</span></span></div><p class=\"miniapp\"></p></div></div>  <div id=\"facsimile-images\"><h2>Facsimile Images</h2><a href=\"ISic001692_tiled.tif\"><img title=\"I.Sicily with the permission of the Assessorato Regionale dei Beni Culturali e dell’Identità Siciliana - Dipartimento dei Beni Culturali e dell’Identità Siciliana\" src=\"ISic001692_tiled-thumb.tif\"></a><a href=\"ISic001692.jpg\"><img title=\"I.Sicily with the permission of the Assessorato Regionale dei Beni Culturali e dell’Identità Siciliana - Dipartimento dei Beni Culturali e dell’Identità Siciliana\" src=\"ISic001692-thumb.jpg\"></a></div>  <div id=\"apparatus\"><h4>Apparatus criticus</h4><ul><li><span>  <span>Text as reported by Kaibel from the manuscript tradition.</span>  </span></li></ul></div>  <div id=\"translation\"><h2> translation</h2><p class=\"translation-author\">  </p><p>  </p></div>  <div id=\"commentary\"><h2>commentary</h2>  <p>As Korhonen 2017 lucidly details, the inscription is one of a series of late 18th century local antiquarian forgeries, constructed on the basis of existing texts, principally those to be found in the 1769 first edition of the corpus of Torremuzza. Kaibel classed the entire series already as forgeries in IG XIV and provides the only modern corpus edition of this text. Korhonen 2017: 199 elucidates this, the only Latin text among them, as being derived from Jan Gruter's corpus (the 1707 posthumous second edition), specifically p.227 no.4 = CIL XIII.566 from Bordeaux, with the same 'Augusto sacrum et genio civitatis' construction.</p>  </div>  <div id=\"bibliography\"><h2>bibliography</h2>  <ul><li> Kaibel 1890 <a href=\"https://clio.columbia.edu/catalog/6873760\" target=\"_blank\">31*</a>  <a href=\"https://biblio.inscriptiones.org/epig10001072\" target=\"_blank\">https://biblio.inscriptiones.org/epig10001072</a>  </li><li> Filippi 2002 <a href=\"https://biblio.inscriptiones.org/epig10001991\" target=\"_blank\">https://biblio.inscriptiones.org/epig10001991</a>  </li><li> Filippi 2005 70 no. 31 / s.n. <a href=\"https://biblio.inscriptiones.org/epig10002296\" target=\"_blank\">https://biblio.inscriptiones.org/epig10002296</a>  </li><li> Korhonen 2017 199 <a href=\"https://biblio.inscriptiones.org/epig10001484\" target=\"_blank\">https://biblio.inscriptiones.org/epig10001484</a>  </li></ul>  <ul><li></li></ul>  </div>  <div id=\"handnote\"> Line 1    Interlineation line 1 to 2    </div><div id=\"license\"> Licensed under a Creative Commons-Attribution 4.0 licence. </div>",
